  "alt": "alt_netting_possible: intervals where a masked cancellation / replenishment could hide (creation interval through the candidate interval, plus unexplained changes up to the candidate record hi); alt_first_addresses: every first-filler address the hard windows and the level life allow (conservative, may over-include)",
